 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Totally normal fear. Lots of people never get over it. Would you rather start on quieter back roads, or bite the bullet and do city driving first? How far is it? If it' short, you could walk or use public transport for the first few days. Start with the fastest mode you have access to, so if you have a friend willing to drive, or you live near a train station, use it. Then every day increase the distance a bit, walking the last bit if you' still nervous.",
